          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misiri, o Yuda, o Edom, lelo ayiok le Amon, o Moab o lelo pooki, oomanya olpurkel oiriri ilpapit lenye! Amu ore kulo oshon pooki nememurata, ore enkaji pooki e Israel nememurata iltauja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
